  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rollup | devDependencies | minor | [`1.12.3` -> `1.13.1`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/rollup/1.12.3/1.13.1) | [source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>rollup/rollup</summary>\n\n### [`v1.13.1`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1131)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.13.0...v1.13.1)\n\n_2019-06-01_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Avoid conflicts between top-level module, require etc. and CommonJS runtimes ([#&#8203;2889](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2889))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2888](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2888): Enable full TypeScript strict mode ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2889](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2889): Protect all module globals for CJS output from being redefined ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.13.0`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1130)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.12.5...v1.13.0)\n\n_2019-05-31_\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Omit `exports` and `module` from SystemJS wrapper if possible ([#&#8203;2880](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2880))\n-   Try to use the first letters of names when mangling exports ([#&#8203;2885](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2885))\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Avoid conflicts with local variables when using format specific globals to render dynamic imports and file URLs ([#&#8203;2880](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2880))\n-   Do not produce undefined reexports when reexporting from entry points ([#&#8203;2885](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2885))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2880](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2880): Deconflict global variables used inside format-specific code ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2885](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2885): Do not produce undefined reexports when reexporting from entry points and refactor chunk linking ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.12.5`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1125)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.12.4...v1.12.5)\n\n_2019-05-30_\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2884](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2884): Update pluginutils for new micormatch and reduced bundle size ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.12.4`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1124)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.12.3...v1.12.4)\n\n_2019-05-27_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Show correct error stack trace for errors throw in \"load\" hooks ([#&#8203;2871](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2871))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2875](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2875): Mention subfolders in docs ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2871](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2871): Reserve error stack information ([@&#8203;LongTengDao](https://togithub.com/LongTengDao))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
